  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 6170d1c959a2065d6b794816b2a5ef88, type: 3}
  m_Name: Dialogue_Vince01
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::CaseClosed.Data.DialogueTreeSO
  treeId: TREE_VINCE_01
  characterId: CHAR_VINCE_BATECAN
  startNodeId: NODE_01
  nodes:
  - nodeId: NODE_01
    speakerId: CHAR_VINCE_BATECAN
    speakerName: Vince Angelo Batecan
    expression: 6
    statementText: I never went near the study! I stayed in the kitchen from 8:30
      PM until everyone started shouting!
    isChallengeable: 0
    targetContradictionRuleId: 
    choices: []
    defaultNextNodeId: NODE_01B_JANE_INTERJECTION
    unlockEvidenceOnComplete: []
  - nodeId: NODE_01B_JANE_INTERJECTION
    speakerId: CHAR_CASE1_FEMALE
    speakerName: Jane Reyes
    expression: 1
    statementText: Wait, Vince... that isn't true. I was walking past the corridor
      at 8:40 PM, and I saw you arguing heatedly with Uncle Kirby near the study.
    isChallengeable: 0
    targetContradictionRuleId: 
    choices: []
    defaultNextNodeId: NODE_01C_VINCE_RETORT
    unlockEvidenceOnComplete: []
  - nodeId: NODE_01C_VINCE_RETORT
    speakerId: CHAR_VINCE_BATECAN
    speakerName: Vince Angelo Batecan
    expression: 3
    statementText: Stay out of this, Jane! You were drinking wine with guests in
      the dining hall! You couldn't possibly see who was in the corridor!
    isChallengeable: 0
    targetContradictionRuleId: 
    choices: []
    defaultNextNodeId: NODE_01D_DETECTIVE_PRESS
    unlockEvidenceOnComplete: []
  - nodeId: NODE_01D_DETECTIVE_PRESS
    speakerId: 
    speakerName: Detective
    expression: 0
    statementText: Both of you, calm down. Vince, Ms. Reyes places you outside the
      study right before the safe was breached. Explain your presence there.
    isChallengeable: 0
    targetContradictionRuleId: 
    choices: []
    defaultNextNodeId: NODE_02_ROOM_LEAD
    unlockEvidenceOnComplete: []
  - nodeId: NODE_02_ROOM_LEAD
    speakerId: CHAR_VINCE_BATECAN
    speakerName: Vince Angelo Batecan
    expression: 6
    statementText: The study was locked, Detective! Even if I walked through the
      hallway, there is nothing in that room connecting me to the necklace.
    isChallengeable: 0
    targetContradictionRuleId: 
    choices: []
    defaultNextNodeId: NODE_02B_JANE_HEARD_CRASH
    unlockEvidenceOnComplete:
    - EVD_BROKEN_TEACUP
  - nodeId: NODE_02B_JANE_HEARD_CRASH
    speakerId: CHAR_CASE1_FEMALE
    speakerName: Jane Reyes
    expression: 8
    statementText: Actually, Detective... while we were in the dining hall, everyone
      heard a loud porcelain crash from inside the study at 8:45 PM.
    isChallengeable: 0
    targetContradictionRuleId: 
    choices: []
    defaultNextNodeId: NODE_02C_DETECTIVE_INSPECT
    unlockEvidenceOnComplete: []
  - nodeId: NODE_02C_DETECTIVE_INSPECT
    speakerId: 
    speakerName: Detective
    expression: 0
    statementText: A porcelain crash inside a locked study... We should examine that
      broken teacup on the table.
    isChallengeable: 0
    targetContradictionRuleId: 
    choices: []
    defaultNextNodeId: 
    unlockEvidenceOnComplete: []
  - nodeId: NODE_03_TEACUP_LEAD
    speakerId: CHAR_VINCE_BATECAN
    speakerName: Vince Angelo Batecan
    expression: 2
    statementText: That broken cup? Alright, so I heard it fall too! But I was nowhere
      near the safe! The pantry log will prove I was in the kitchen.
    isChallengeable: 0
    targetContradictionRuleId: 
    choices: []
    defaultNextNodeId: NODE_03B_JANE_KITCHEN_LOCK
    unlockEvidenceOnComplete:
    - EVD_KITCHEN_LOG
  - nodeId: NODE_03B_JANE_KITCHEN_LOCK
    speakerId: CHAR_CASE1_FEMALE
    speakerName: Jane Reyes
    expression: 8
    statementText: Vince, don't you remember? The butler locked the kitchen pantry
      before 8:30 PM to prepare for the late tea service.
    isChallengeable: 0
    targetContradictionRuleId: 
    choices: []
    defaultNextNodeId: NODE_03C_DETECTIVE_CHALLENGE
    unlockEvidenceOnComplete: []
  - nodeId: NODE_03C_DETECTIVE_CHALLENGE
    speakerId: 
    speakerName: Detective
    expression: 0
    statementText: The kitchen log is on the desk, Vince. If you were truly locked
      in that pantry, the staff records will verify it. Are you certain that is your
      story?
    isChallengeable: 0
    targetContradictionRuleId: 
    choices: []
    defaultNextNodeId: NODE_04_FINAL_ALIBI
    unlockEvidenceOnComplete: []
  - nodeId: NODE_04_FINAL_ALIBI
    speakerId: CHAR_VINCE_BATECAN
    speakerName: Vince Angelo Batecan
    expression: 6
    statementText: "I stayed in that kitchen the entire time! Inspect the pantry
      log yourself\u2014you cannot prove otherwise!"
    isChallengeable: 1
    targetContradictionRuleId: RULE_VINCE_ALIBI_LIE
    choices: []
    defaultNextNodeId: 
    unlockEvidenceOnComplete: []
  - nodeId: NODE_05_CONFESSION
    speakerId: CHAR_VINCE_BATECAN
    speakerName: Vince Angelo Batecan
    expression: 2
    statementText: W-what?! The kitchen pantry was locked by staff from 8:30 to 9:15
      PM?! Fine! I needed money to clear my gambling debts, so I took the necklace!
    isChallengeable: 0
    targetContradictionRuleId: 
    choices: []
    defaultNextNodeId: NODE_05B_JANE_SHOCKED
    unlockEvidenceOnComplete: []
  - nodeId: NODE_05B_JANE_SHOCKED
    speakerId: CHAR_CASE1_FEMALE
    speakerName: Jane Reyes
    expression: 4
    statementText: Vince... Uncle Kirby took you in and paid your tuition! How could
      you betray our family like this?!
    isChallengeable: 0
    targetContradictionRuleId: 
    choices: []
    defaultNextNodeId: NODE_05C_VINCE_DESPERATE
    unlockEvidenceOnComplete: []
  - nodeId: NODE_05C_VINCE_DESPERATE
    speakerId: CHAR_VINCE_BATECAN
    speakerName: Vince Angelo Batecan
    expression: 2
    statementText: He was cutting off my allowance, Jane! The loan sharks gave me
      until midnight! I panicked and grabbed the necklace from the safe!
    isChallengeable: 0
    targetContradictionRuleId: 
    choices: []
    defaultNextNodeId: NODE_05D_DETECTIVE_CLOSE
    unlockEvidenceOnComplete: []
  - nodeId: NODE_05D_DETECTIVE_CLOSE
    speakerId: 
    speakerName: Detective
    expression: 0
    statementText: That's enough. You broke the teacup during the theft, and the
      pantry log shattered your false alibi. Vince Angelo Batecan, you are under
      arrest.
    isChallengeable: 0
    targetContradictionRuleId: 
    choices: []
    defaultNextNodeId: 
    unlockEvidenceOnComplete: []
